@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Get all courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses

### Get course by ID (update with actual ID)
@courseId = your-course-id-here
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{courseId}}

### Create a new course
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
