### Update a course
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{courseId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pebble Beach Golf Links (Updated)"
}

### Delete a course
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{courseId}}
